    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, been feeling really weird lately. had the flu a few weeks ago and finally felt better, but now i'm just super wiped out. like, even walking up the stairs makes me feel out of breath and my heart feels like it's racing/thumping in my chest. i also feel this weird heaviness in my chest sometimes. is this just part of that post-flu fatigue thing or should i be worried?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
