      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand your concerns about time and money, but delaying a doctor's visit may not be the best option. Fatigue, breathlessness, and a racing heart can be warning signs of an underlying issue, and waiting it out could lead to more severe complications. Your symptoms are persistent and not just fatigue, which warrants further investigation. Consider prioritizing your health and scheduling a doctor's appointment, even if it's an emergency room visit.",
      "source": "target",
